<div class="container">

<h1>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis</h1>
<p class="subtitle">5,000 secondary-market transactions &middot; January 2023 – September 2025 &middot; 5 Models &middot; 9 Colorways &middot; 5 Sales Channels</p>

<!-- KPI Dashboard -->
<div class="kpi-grid">
